# Required — Gemini vision extraction via /api/extract
# Get a free key: https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
#
# COST SAFETY:
# - Keep Google Cloud BILLING OFF for this project.
# - Free tier only — do not upgrade to paid / Tier 1.
# - Put the real key in .env.local ONLY (never commit it here).
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Optional — defaults to gemini-3.5-flash-lite (fast free-tier vision)
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-3.5-flash-lite

# Optional — Twilio SMS reminders (stretch).
# Trial accounts can ONLY text verified numbers in the Twilio console.
TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID=
TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN=
TWILIO_FROM_NUMBER=
